{"id": "EUVD-2026-93336", "enisaUuid": "fbe42c16-9a85-34ed-97f0-d7e19c519eae", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: virt_wifi: free skb when disconnected\n\nWhen the simulated link is disconnected, virt_wifi_start_xmit() returns\nNET_XMIT_DROP without freeing the skb. dev_hard_start_xmit() treats this\nreturn value as consumed, so every packet sent while disconnected leaks its\nskb.\n\nFree the skb before returning the drop status.", "datePublished": "2026-10-06T08:46:39", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:18:02", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/38d3a5df85345f158f78b478b265ca906224454e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ee053ea35c759135460f03d1c574f4ed08de844a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d177eca79e1106834bc423d3969a4a2e3987996a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/36727a702cf8e3399e3da60d0856378f6afcfb34", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/56469996c10a0240653fc00576b4d33bdfb4cc51", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4f266738af45675faa0e8afee08c6e780afa8b06", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/46371442847a725cc0df3697fea2eba1dd54b82b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f9edf7cf63b96d2b776fca8d258d3c5256e40c8e"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98351", "GHSA-g85q-82h3-fmh4"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0556da68-6a22-3211-8430-7969230edfe1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.1.189"}, {"id": "28250d62-ca9e-3a97-9e46-6693e3047183", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "c7cdba31ed8b87526db978976392802d3f93110c <38d3a5df85345f158f78b478b265ca906224454e"}, {"id": "3aec1b3c-fa91-3f4d-9878-274fafe430d5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "c7cdba31ed8b87526db978976392802d3f93110c <56469996c10a0240653fc00576b4d33bdfb4cc51"}, {"id": "45d312d8-bb3c-3255-946f-af2573624f8c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "pro